                <pb facs="0866" n="748" xml:id="pg748"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.7112A/7: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Patterson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-08-11T13:00:00+01:44">August 11, 1928—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 11—11:15 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>33. Department’s telegram 30, August 10, 4. p.m. Roumanian Minister for Foreign
                    Affairs ad interim states minor differences in treaty of arbitration submitted
                    to Roumanian Minister at Washington for discussion with Department of State.
                    Until reply thereto received unable to grant full powers.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Patterson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
